    "Ultra mode adds HDR bloom to supported wallpapers and is only recommended for powerful high-end desktop graphics cards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超高模式可将 HDR 高光添加到支持的壁纸中，建议仅用于功能强大的高端台式机显卡。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "極致模式為支援的桌布新增 HDR 光暈效果，僅建議用於高階桌上型顯示卡。"
          }
